Scope of this license

This license applies to project-original Aliro application code and additions
that do not already have an explicit license. The separate licenses listed in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and LICENSES/MIT.txt remain in force. In particular,
third-party code, inherited HomeKey-ESP32 sources and DigitalDoorKey (including
our changes to those MIT sources) retain their original license. The PM3 Python
package retains the MIT license declared in pyproject.toml. This notice does not
withdraw permissions previously granted under an existing license.

More specific file notices take precedence. These include the CC BY-SA 4.0
objDiff.ts helpers, GPL-licensed Autoconf macros with their retained output
exception, and CC0-marked material described in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. This
license adds no commercial-use, attribution, sublicensing or contribution
restrictions to separately licensed material. Section 6 concerns contributions
to original code covered by this license; other files keep their own licenses.
Copyright is not assigned by that contribution clause. This copyright license
does not grant third-party patent, trademark or certification rights.

