       with attribution to aliro.mayday.software.
   (d) Contributing pull requests, issues, and patches to the upstream
       repository.
   (e) Auditing the software in the context of evaluating whether to
       obtain a Commercial Licence (see §2).
   (f) Copying, compiling and modifying the covered code, including making
       forks and derivative versions, for the uses permitted by (a)-(e).
       You may keep those modifications private.
   (g) Redistributing unmodified or modified covered code, in source or
       compiled form, without charge and for the non-commercial uses
